@startuml
title AnimeDex — Edge Function ⇄ Browser Scraper (ANX-SEC 1.1)
actor "Cliente Stremio" as Client
participant "Supabase Edge Function" as Edge
participant "Proxy HTTPS" as Proxy
participant "Worker Express / Token" as Worker
participant "Scraper autorizado" as Scraper
Client -> Edge: GET manifest/catalog/meta
Edge -> Edge: Deno.env WORKER_API_TOKEN
alt Configuração ausente ou HTTP remoto
  Edge --> Client: Fallback de API ou erro controlado
else URL HTTPS e token forte
  Edge -> Proxy: HTTPS Authorization Bearer
  Proxy -> Worker: HTTP loopback 127.0.0.1:8787
  alt Token inválido
    Worker --> Proxy: 401/503
    Proxy --> Edge: Erro
    Edge --> Client: Fallback ou erro
  else Token correto
    Worker -> Scraper: Consulta autorizada
    Scraper --> Worker: JSON/HTML
    Worker --> Proxy: 200 JSON
    Proxy --> Edge: 200 JSON
    Edge --> Client: Manifest/catalog/meta
  end
end
note over Worker
  /health isenta apenas para healthcheck
  Sandbox Chromium, TLS real e SSRF em navegador
  ainda requerem homologação
end note
@enduml
